<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28819410"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1788209578"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Love Letter"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MY FIRST STORY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Black Rail"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:31.600"><div begin="00:00.000" end="04:31.600"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:06.650" itunes:key="L1">Love Letter - MY FIRST STORY (マイ・ファースト・ストーリー)</p><p begin="00:06.650" end="00:13.300" itunes:key="L2">作詞：MY FIRST STORY<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">saku xi ： MY FIRST STORY</span></p><p begin="00:13.300" end="00:19.950" itunes:key="L3">作曲：MY FIRST STORY<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa kiyoku ： MY FIRST STORY</span></p><p begin="00:19.950" end="00:24.690" itunes:key="L4">もし願いが叶うのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果愿望可以成真</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo xi nega i ga kana wu no na la</span></p><p begin="00:24.690" end="00:39.160" itunes:key="L5">最初で最後の幸せ信じるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿相信有永恒的幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sai xiyo de sai go no xi a wa se xin ji lu no</span></p><p begin="00:39.160" end="00:43.830" itunes:key="L6">2人で1つになれた日から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自和你融为一体的那天起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">futa li de hito cu ni na re ta hi ka la</span></p><p begin="00:43.830" end="00:50.550" itunes:key="L7">沢山の愛の言葉を探したね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就一直在寻找众多的爱的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">taku san no ai no koto ba wo saga xi ta ne</span></p><p begin="00:50.550" end="00:58.090" itunes:key="L8">世界で誰よりきっと幸せな気がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉自己是世界上最幸福的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se kai de dare yo li ki to xi a wa se na ki ga xi ta</span></p><p begin="00:58.090" end="01:04.210" itunes:key="L9">この日々が決して終わらぬ様にと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿这时光永远都不会结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no hi bi ga ke xi te o wa la nu you ni to</span></p><p begin="01:04.210" end="01:11.030" itunes:key="L10">いつまでも変わらぬまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远 一如当初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cu ma de mo ka wa la nu ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:11.030" end="01:13.260" itunes:key="L11">I love you now and forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 亘古不变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you now and forever</span></p><p begin="01:13.260" end="01:15.680" itunes:key="L12">Will be beside you forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远陪伴在你左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Will be beside you forever</span></p><p begin="01:15.680" end="01:17.950" itunes:key="L13">Our love will last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 至死不渝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Our love will last forever</span></p><p begin="01:17.950" end="01:20.420" itunes:key="L14">君の為なら!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要是为了你!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi no tame na la !</span></p><p begin="01:20.420" end="01:22.830" itunes:key="L15">I love you now and forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 亘古不变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you now and forever</span></p><p begin="01:22.830" end="01:25.300" itunes:key="L16">Will be beside you forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远陪伴在你左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Will be beside you forever</span></p><p begin="01:25.300" end="01:27.480" itunes:key="L17">Our love will last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 至死不渝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Our love will last forever</span></p><p begin="01:27.480" end="01:31.270" itunes:key="L18">ただ愛してるのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ai xi te lu no wa</span></p><p begin="01:31.270" end="01:48.800" itunes:key="L19">他でも誰でもなくただ1人 君だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是其他人 而是世上独一无二的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hoka de mo dare de mo na ku ta da hito li kimi da ka la</span></p><p begin="01:48.800" end="01:53.480" itunes:key="L20">奇跡や運命信じるより<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其相信奇迹与命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki seki ya wun mei xin ji lu yo li</span></p><p begin="01:53.480" end="02:00.060" itunes:key="L21">永遠の愛を形に出来るなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若永恒的爱能够捕捉得到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ei en no ai wo kataqi ni de ki lu na la</span></p><p begin="02:00.060" end="02:07.730" itunes:key="L22">どれだけ僕ら2人 幸せになるかな?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将会多么地幸福呢?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do re da ke boku la futa li xi a wa se ni na lu ka na ?</span></p><p begin="02:07.730" end="02:16.230" itunes:key="L23">嬉しくて笑顔溢れ出す日々を過ごすから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我共度洋溢欢乐笑容的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wure xi ku te e gao afu re da su hi bi wo su go su ka la</span></p><p begin="02:16.230" end="02:25.910" itunes:key="L24">だけど悲しくて涙流した夜でも繋がれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因悲伤而流泪的夜晚也加深了我们之间的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do kana xi ku te namida naga xi ta yolu de mo cuna ga re lu</span></p><p begin="02:25.910" end="02:32.620" itunes:key="L25">君といれば!!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要和你在一起!!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi to i re ba !!</span></p><p begin="02:32.620" end="02:34.890" itunes:key="L26">I love you now and forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 亘古不变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you now and forever</span></p><p begin="02:34.890" end="02:37.240" itunes:key="L27">Will be beside you forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远陪伴在你左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Will be beside you forever</span></p><p begin="02:37.240" end="02:39.500" itunes:key="L28">Our love will last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 至死不渝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Our love will last forever</span></p><p begin="02:39.500" end="02:42.060" itunes:key="L29">君の為なら!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要是为了你!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi no tame na la !</span></p><p begin="02:42.060" end="02:44.480" itunes:key="L30">I love you now and forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 亘古不变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you now and forever</span></p><p begin="02:44.480" end="02:46.680" itunes:key="L31">Will be beside you forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远陪伴在你左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Will be beside you forever</span></p><p begin="02:46.680" end="02:48.960" itunes:key="L32">Our love will last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 至死不渝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Our love will last forever</span></p><p begin="02:48.960" end="02:52.840" itunes:key="L33">ただ愛してるのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ai xi te lu no wa</span></p><p begin="02:52.840" end="03:07.760" itunes:key="L34">他でも誰でもなくただ1人 君だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是其他人 而是世上独一无二的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hoka de mo dare de mo na ku ta da hito li kimi da ka la</span></p><p begin="03:07.760" end="03:17.460" itunes:key="L35">I'll always give you all my love.<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会把我所有的爱都给你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'll always give you all my love.</span></p><p begin="03:17.460" end="03:20.530" itunes:key="L36">I swear to love you with my life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓我会用一生去爱你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I swear to love you with my life</span></p><p begin="03:20.530" end="03:22.820" itunes:key="L37">神様お願い。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向神起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kami sama o nega i 。</span></p><p begin="03:22.820" end="03:27.430" itunes:key="L38">このまま2人で永久に響くまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样2个人在一起 直到永远回响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma futa li de to wa ni hibi ku ma de</span></p><p begin="03:27.430" end="03:29.990" itunes:key="L39">何処か遠くへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传至远方的某处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka too ku he</span></p><p begin="03:29.990" end="03:34.840" itunes:key="L40">どんな言葉でも伝えきれないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">千言万语都难以表达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na koto ba de mo cuta e ki re na i no</span></p><p begin="03:34.840" end="03:44.600" itunes:key="L41">今は君以外愛せないから!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在除了你我谁都不爱!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ima wa kimi i gai ai se na i ka la !</span></p><p begin="03:44.600" end="03:49.220" itunes:key="L42">あの日あの時あの言葉の意味<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天那时那句话的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi a no toki a no koto ba no i mi</span></p><p begin="03:49.220" end="03:54.070" itunes:key="L43">君がくれたのは僕への愛で!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你所给我的 就是对我的爱!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ga ku re ta no wa boku he no ai de !</span></p><p begin="03:54.070" end="03:56.460" itunes:key="L44">I love you now and forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你 亘古不变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I love you now and forever</span></p><p begin="03:56.460" end="03:58.820" itunes:key="L45">Will be beside you forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会永远陪伴在你左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Will be beside you forever</span></p><p begin="03:58.820" end="04:00.970" itunes:key="L46">Our love will last forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱 至死不渝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Our love will last forever</span></p><p begin="04:00.970" end="04:04.890" itunes:key="L47">君を愛せるのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此深爱你的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi wo ai se lu no wa</span></p><p begin="04:04.890" end="04:31.600" itunes:key="L48">他でも誰でもなくただ1人 僕だけだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是其他人 是这世上独一无二的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hoka de mo dare de mo na ku ta da hito li boku da ke da yo</span></p></div></body></tt>